comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-26T13:14:50.610Z","harness:codex","Duplicate evidence 2026-07-26: all-status exact/keyword searches for PmClient process-wide activation queue, unrelated workspaces, multi-user hosts, extension activation concurrency, and registry serialization found no matching open or closed item. Closed pm-bl6m is the MCP request-scoped-registry precursor, not this PmClient cross-workspace throughput defect. Canonical GitHub issue: GH-742."
